# Workers Static Assets does not support domain-level redirects.
# A rule such as:
#   https://www.seniorschools.org/*  https://seniorschools.org/:splat  301
# is not applied (Cloudflare marks "Domain-level redirects" unsupported).
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# Host 301s that preserve path and query are dashboard Bulk Redirects.
# They run in front of this Worker. See docs/deploy-cloudflare.md.
#
#   www.seniorschools.org
#   seniorschoolnetwork.com
#   www.seniorschoolnetwork.com
#   seniorschoolnetwork.org
#   www.seniorschoolnetwork.org
#     → https://seniorschools.org/<path>?<query>  (301)
#
# Path-only redirects belong in this file, one per line, for example:
# /old-path   /new-path   301
